Subject: [PATCH 1730/3799] soh: rename func_808B43D0 -> BgSpot15Rrbox_Fall

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: drops the crate under gravity, cancels any push while it is airborne, and complains and recovers if it falls out of the world.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c         | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c
